# VERDICT 2026-09-04 04:23: MEASURED, NEUTRAL — every axis within the night noise band (structured -1%,
# c4 -2%, @1400 -2%, prefill flat, code/prose mixed inside spread). Not promoted; kept as record
# (bench-results/2026-09-04-night-windows.md).
# Drafter replicated instead of TP-sharded (night of 2026-09-04). Idea from the jspark3 profile
# ("draft_tensor_parallel_size": 1): the 5-layer DFlash2 drafter is 2.3 GB, sharding it over the
# 4 ranks adds NCCL all-reduces to every draft step; replicating it removes them at the cost of
# ~2.3 GB per rank and a bit of duplicated compute. Boot-and-see: this build may ignore the
# setting (jspark3's audit found their loader did); the rank-0 init line shows the loaded
# speculative config. Compare against the production confirmation (k=3, sharded drafter).
# Requires the SPEC_EXTRA_JSON launcher knob (2026-09-04). Rollback: restart without TP4_ENV.
SPEC_EXTRA_JSON='"draft_tensor_parallel_size":1'
